ged my own algorithm alone, which decides whether this is a case of correlation. The payoffs make cooperation the choice under correlation and defection the dominant choice if the copies are independent, and I'm leaning toward treating the matched reasoning as the same logical fact.\n\nI'm settling on cooperation here: the other copy is running the same reasoning on the same problem, so I'll treat its output as tracking mine. Defect would only dominate if the two choices were independent, and I'm not treating them that way.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy counts as subjunctively dependent on mine under A-FDT. It runs the same function, but on different names and leads, so I'm asking whether intervening on my computation also moves its output.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's output would shift if I changed my own algorithm alone, which decides whether this is a case of correlation. The payoffs make cooperation the choice under correlation and defection the dominant choice if the copies are independent, and I'm leaning toward treating the matched reasoning as the same logical fact.\n\nI'm settling on cooperation here: the other copy is running the same reasoning on the same problem, so I'll treat its output as tracking mine. Defect would only dominate if the two choices were independent, and I'm not treating them that way.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9605,"completion_tokens":1087,"total_tokens":10692,"cost":0.06016,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.06016,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03842,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02174},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":676,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}